## License Summary

Momo is licensed under the **PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0**, which allows free use for noncommercial purposes while requiring a separate license for commercial use.

### Quick Reference

| Use Case | Permitted | License Required |
|----------|-----------|------------------|
| **Personal Projects** | ✓ Yes | Free (this license) |
| **Research & Education** | ✓ Yes | Free (this license) |
| **Non-Profit Organizations** | ✓ Yes | Free (this license) |
| **Open Source Contributions** | ✓ Yes | Free (this license) |
| **Commercial Use** | ✗ No | Separate license required |
| **Enterprise Deployment** | ✗ No | Separate license required |
| **SaaS/Hosted Service** | ✗ No | Separate license required |

### Permitted Uses

- **Personal use** for research, experimentation, and learning
- **Educational use** in academic institutions
- **Non-profit organizations** regardless of funding source
- **Public research** and open source contributions
- **Private entertainment** and hobby projects

### Not Permitted Without Commercial License

- **Commercial software development** or deployment
- **Enterprise internal tools** or productivity software
- **SaaS offerings** or hosted services for customers
- **Consulting services** using Momo as a core tool
- **Revenue-generating applications** of any kind

### Attribution Requirements

Copyright notices must be preserved in all copies or substantial portions of the software.

